Subject: zram: fixup read_block_state()
To: stable@vger.kernel.org
Cc: Sergey Senozhatsky <senozhatsky@chromium.org>, Chris Mason <clm@meta.com>, Brian Geffon <bgeffon@google.com>, David Stevens <stevensd@google.com>, Minchan Kim <minchan@google.com>, Richard Chang <richardycc@google.com>, Andrew Morton <akpm@linux-foundation.org>, Sasha Levin <sashal@kernel.org>
